(staged-rocket-trace)
*title Named staged rocket trace with payload deployment
*method rk4-fixed variable-mass
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84
*file staged_rocket_trace.dat time alt vel range gamgd psigd wt

*trajectory 1 launch_vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic time=0 wt=12000 alt=0 lat=0 long=0 vel=0 gama=90 psi=90
  *print time alt vel range gamgd psigd wt plength
  *segment 1 rail-and-first-stage
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.02
    *rail launch azm=90 elev=85 cfstat=0.15 cfslid=0.01
    *aero caxial=0.8 cnormal=0.1
    *prop thrust=60000 mdot=8
    *when plength>50 goto 2
  *segment 2 staging
    *increment wt=-350
    *aero caxial=0.5 cnormal=0.08
    *prop thrust=42000 mdot=5
    *when tseg>40 goto 3
  *segment 3 coast
    *aero constant_beta=200
    *when alt<0 stop

*trajectory 2 payload start on 1
  *deployed from trajectory 1, segment 2, wt=2100
  *print time alt vel range gamgd psigd wt
  *segment 1 payload-coast
    *aero constant_beta=200
    *when alt<0 stop
*end
